    "body": "So I think the issue is that during showPopover, newPopover won't be showing yet. See [showPopover](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/popover.html#show-popover). Step 2 should reset the invoker to null (so we're ok), step 8.2 runs \"topmost popover ancestor\" (this algo), and step 13 sets it to showing. So a) we're ok, and b) you can't assert that it's showing here.",
